WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:16.660
Women make 25% of 
the films in Iran, compared to 4% in the US.By

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:28.150
2025, there will be more English speakers
in China than in the rest of the world put

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.150
together.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:34.659
+
It takes 3,000 cows to supply the NFL with

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:37.940
enough leather for a year's supply of footballs.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:42.660
A ball of glass will bounce higher than a
ball of rubber.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:50.239
And a ball of solid steel will bounce higher
than one made entirely of glass.

00:00:50.239 --> 00:00:52.379
Gram for gram, hamburgers cost more than new
cars.

00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:56.319
The sentence, "The quick brown fox jumps over
the lazy dog."

00:00:56.319 --> 00:01:03.969
uses every letter in the alphabet.

00:01:03.969 --> 00:01:07.570
For this reason it is often used to showcase
typefaces.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:17.969
A full moon is nine times brighter than a
half moon.

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:20.549
Dartboards are made out of horse hairs.

00:01:20.549 --> 00:01:26.880
Beethoven would dip his head in cold water
before he composed to stimulate his mind.

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:33.609
A jiffy is an actual unit of time, it's 1/100th
of a second.

00:01:33.609 --> 00:01:37.929
Russia didn't consider beer to be an alcoholic
beverage until 2011.

00:01:37.929 --> 00:01:42.840
It was previously classified as a soft drink.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:49.499
Months that begin on a Sunday will always
have a Friday the 13th.

00:01:49.499 --> 00:01:56.100
The Titanic had a sister ship called the Olympic
and it provided 25 years of good service.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.560
During its lifetime an oyster changes its
sex from male to female and back several times.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.829
The average secretary's left hand does 56%
of the typing.

00:02:03.829 --> 00:02:06.689
Despite China having a population of 1.4 billion.

00:02:06.689 --> 00:02:12.370
There are only about 200 different surnames
in China.

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:16.780
Cotton candy was invented by a dentist.

